### Create an ingredient — Ketchup, 42 lb case
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ingredients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ketchup",
  "purchaseUnit": "LB",
  "purchasePrice": 42.00,
  "purchaseAmount": 42,
  "category": "Condiment",
  "yieldPct": 1.0
}

### Get all ingredients
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ingredients

### Get one ingredient by id (change the 1 once you know the real id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ingredients/1package grillogic.config;

### Create a recipe using Ketchup (id=1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Burger",
  "servings": 1,
  "menuPrice": 12.00,
  "laborCostPct": 0.30,
  "ingredients": [
    {
      "ingredientId": 1,
      "amount": 2,
      "amountUnit": "OZ"
    }
  ]
}

### Get the recipe's cost
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recipes/1/cost

### Update Ketchup (id=1) — change price
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/ingredients/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ketchup",
  "purchaseUnit": "LB",
  "purchasePrice": 45.00,
  "purchaseAmount": 42,
  "category": "Condiment",
  "yieldPct": 1.0
}

### Confirm the update
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ingredients/1

### Update Test Burger (id=1) — bump ketchup amount to 4 oz
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/recipes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Burger",
  "servings": 1,
  "menuPrice": 12.00,
  "laborCostPct": 0.30,
  "ingredients": [
    {
      "ingredientId": 1,
      "amount": 4,
      "amountUnit": "OZ"
    }
  ]
}

### Confirm the recipe cost changed
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recipes/1/cost

### Delete the recipe
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/recipes/1

### Confirm it's gone (should 404/error)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recipes/1/cost

### Delete the ingredient
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/ingredients/1

### Confirm it's gone (should error)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ingredients/1

### Clean up leftover duplicate recipe
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/recipes/2

### Sign up a test user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@grillogic.com",
  "password": "supersecret123"
}

### Login with correct password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@grillogic.com",
  "password": "supersecret123"
}

### Login with WRONG password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@grillogic.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### Try hitting a protected endpoint WITHOUT a token — should now be rejected
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ingredients

### Login again to get a fresh token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@grillogic.com",
  "password": "supersecret123"
}

