### Smoked Pork Butt sub-recipe — no dedicated labor (blended into shift)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recipes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0QGdyaWxsb2dpYy5jb20iLCJyb2xlIjoiQURNSU4iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODUzNzY2NDMsImV4cCI6MTc4NTQ2MzA0M30.lvq4_mj4Cmg2tmDR0tY5flfB8rnQ7k_-7zU1Zx6jc5Sg-l3SEpVd6vtUn8sPPIr_

